#: digikam/albummanager.cpp:432
msgid ""
"<p>Failed to open the database. </p>"
"<p>You cannot use digiKam without a working database. digiKam will attempt to start now, but it will <b>not</b> be functional. Please check the database settings in the <b>configuration menu</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>De Datenbank lett sik nich opmaken.</p>"
"<p>Du kannst digiKam nich ahn en lopen Datenbank bruken. DigiKam fangt nu <b>ahn Datenbank</b> an, man warrt nich funkscheneren, as dat schall. Prööv bitte de Datenbank-Instellen binnen dat <b>Instellen-Menü</b>.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/albummanager.cpp:440
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Failed to open the database.  Error message from database: %1 </p>"
"<p>You cannot use digiKam without a working database. digiKam will attempt to start now, but it will <b>not</b> be functional. Please check the database settings in the <b>configuration menu</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>De Datenbank lett sik nich opmaken. Fehlermellen: %1</p>"
"<p>Du kannst digiKam nich ahn en lopen Datenbank bruken. DigiKam fangt nu <b>ahn Datenbank</b> an, man warrt nich funkscheneren, as dat schall. Prööv bitte de Datenbank-Instellen binnen dat <b>Instellen-Menü</b>.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/albummanager.cpp:508
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Your locale has changed since this album was last opened.\n"
"Old Locale : %1, New Locale : %2\n"
"If you changed your locale lately, this is all right.\n"
"Please notice that if you switched to a locale that does not support some of the file names in your collection, these files may no longer be found in the collection. If you are sure that you want to continue, click 'Yes'. Otherwise, click 'No' and correct your locale setting before restarting digiKam."
msgstr ""
"Dien Regiooninstellen hett sik na't verleden Opmaken vun dit Album ännert.\n"
"Ole Regioon: %1, niege Regioon: %2\n"
"Wenn Du Dien Regiooninstellen annerlest ännert hest, hett allens sien Schick.\n"
"Beacht bitte: Wenn dat binnen Dien Sammeln Dateinaams gifft, de sik mit de niege Regiooninstellen nich schrieven laat, dukt disse Dateien nich mehr binnen de Sammeln op. Wenn Du seker büst, Du wullt so wiedermaken, klick op \"Jo\". Wenn nich, denn klick op \"Nee\" un richt Dien Regiooninstellen, ehr Du digiKam nochmaal opröppst."

