msgstr "/Biller"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:99
msgid ""
"<p>Please enter a location where you want to store your images.</p>"
" "
"<p>You can choose any local folder, even one that already contains images.<br/>"
" More folders can be added later under the <i>Settings</i> menu. </p>"
" "
"<p><i>Note:</i> Removable media (like USB drives) and shared file systems (both NFS or Samba) are supported.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Giff bitte de Steed in, woneem Du Dien Biller wohren wullt.</p>"
" "
"<p>Du kannst jichtenseen lokaal Orner utsöken, un ok een, binnen den Du al Biller hest.<br/>"
" Du kannst later noch binnen dat <i>Instellen</i>-Menü anner Ornern tofögen.</p>"
" "
"<p><i>Beacht:</i> Tuuschbor Medien (as USB-Loopwarken) un deelt Dateisystemen (a.B. NFS un Samba) warrt ok ünnerstütt.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:112
msgid ""
"<p>digiKam stores information and meta-data about your images in a database file. Please set the location of this file or accept the default.</p>"
"<p><i>Note:</i> You need to have write access to the folder used here, and you cannot use a remote location on a networked server, using NFS or Samba.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>DigiKam wohrt Informatschonen un Metadaten över Dien Biller binnen en Datrenbankdatei. Legg bitte de Steed för disse Datei fast, oder beglööv de Standardinstellen.</p>"
"<p><i>Beacht:</i> Du bruukst Schriefverlöven för den dissen Orner, un Du kannst keen feern Steed op en anner - mit NFS oder Samba tokoppelt - Server in't Nettwark bruken.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:165
msgid "You must select a folder for digiKam to use as the root album. All of your images will go there."
msgstr "Du muttst en Orner utsöken, den digiKam as Wörtelalbum bruken schall. All Dien Biller kaamt dor rin."

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:179
msgid "digiKam will not use your home folder as the root album. Please select another location."
msgstr "DigiKam kann Dien Tohuusorner nich as Wörtelalbum bruken. Söök bitte en anner Steed ut."

#. +> trunk
#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The folder to use as the root album path does not exist: "
"<p><b>%1</b></p>"
"Would you like digiKam to create it for you?"
msgstr ""
"Den Orner, den digiKam as Wörtelalbum bruken schall, gifft dat nich: "
"<p><b>%1</b></p>"
"Schall digiKam em nu för Di opstellen?"

